 "description": "Is this business (name, registration or 13-digit corporate number) on a Japan FSA register or warning list? Exact match (optional domain) against FSA registers (financial instruments, crypto-asset exchange, electronic payment instruments, funds transfer, money lending) and warnings to unregistered businesses. Returns matches with registration type, entity tie (domain alone: unverified), name candidates and as-of dates. Stated scope only; no warning match is not proof none exists. No advice.",
 "execution": {
  "taskSupport": "forbidden"
 },
